          "text": "A fantasy and science-fiction world Skye has been developing for twenty years, with its own geography, cultures and extensive history. It began in AIM roleplay, where she founded the company behind SRX and Shinra. That world now extends into Realm Knights, a Discord adventure game; The Realm: Third Age, a fully AI-driven roleplaying experience built for Discord; and numerous videos and characters."
