          "text": "An early entry about Skye teaching herself to customize LiveJournal and making an HTML prototype of her ideal layout.\n\n“A quick overview. I changed my LJ, I did it myself this time. I learned the ropes and I've got the hang of it now. I experimented for about 3 hours until I got back to what I liked. I even made my own HTML prototype of my dream layout.”\n\n— Mercury — journal, February 23, 2004"
